{"q":"148","t":"Sort List","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given the <code>head</code> of a linked list, return <em>the list after sorting it in <strong>ascending order</strong></em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/28677ee483f203d3.jpg\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 194px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> head = [4,2,1,3]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [1,2,3,4]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/9f9d7b3182de36c7.jpg\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 184px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> head = [-1,5,3,4,0]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [-1,0,3,4,5]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> head = []\n<strong>Output:</strong> []\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the list is in the range <code>[0, 5 * 10<sup>4</sup>]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>5</sup> &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Follow up:</strong> Can you sort the linked list in <code>O(n logn)</code> time and <code>O(1)</code> memory (i.e. constant space)?</p>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"sortList\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"head\",\r\n      \"type\": \"ListNode\",\r\n      \"dealloc\": false\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"ListNode\",\r\n    \"dealloc\": true\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Linked List","slug":"linked-list"},{"name":"Two Pointers","slug":"two-pointers"},{"name":"Divide and Conquer","slug":"divide-and-conquer"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"},{"name":"Merge Sort","slug":"merge-sort"}],"s":[{"t":"Merge Two Sorted Lists","s":"merge-two-sorted-lists","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Sort Colors","s":"sort-colors","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Insertion Sort List","s":"insertion-sort-list","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Sort Linked List Already Sorted Using Absolute Values","s":"sort-linked-list-already-sorted-using-absolute-values","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Oracle","oracle"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Lyft","lyft"],["ByteDance","bytedance"]]}